<title>JAPAN: Daiei ask-only after earnings forecast revision.</title>
<headline>Daiei ask-only after earnings forecast revision.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiei Inc shares were ask-only in Thursday morning trade after the supermarket chain revised down its earnings forecast on Wednesday, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0029 GMT, the shares were ask-only at 736 yen. It closed at 746 yen on the previous day.  </p>
<p>Daiei said that it expected its parent current profit to be 500 million yen in the year to February 28, down from a previous forecast of 13.0 billion yen.</p>
